{
  "name": "mira_active",
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "description": "DSH 自我激活插件（闹钟）：一条配置=一个闹钟（alarmId 为键，条目带 sessionId），支持单次/每日/间隔/随机、条目级静默时段、失败退避与自动停用；到点用 steer（插话）向会话注入一条用户消息，会话忙也插到最近一步，绝不排队",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "cordis",
    "plugin",
    "scheduler",
    "wakeup"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Stella-Mira/mira_active.git"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  }
}
